OL,3,GNEWSAPolice seek other victims of
OL,4,Apredatory rapist
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice believe there are other victims
OL,7,Fof a "calculating predatory offender"
OL,8,Fwho has been found guilty of three
OL,9,Frapes against vulnerable teenage girls.
OL,11,FLema Nsimba, 37, from Milton Keynes,
OL,12,Fwas also found guilty of numerous
OL,13,Fsexual offences, following a trial at
OL,14,FAylesbury Crown Court.
OL,16,FDet Supt Andy Alexander, from Thames
OL,17,FValley Police, said Nsimba created
OL,18,Ffalse personas using the online message
OL,19,Fservice Snapchat so he could exploit
OL,20,Fgirls for his "own sexual
OL,21,Fgratification".
